      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, that makes sense. So it's basically just a cycle of glucose and byproduct. Does the buildup of the acid itself actually cause the muscle damage/soreness later on, or is that something else entirely? I've heard people talk about micro-tears too.",
      "source": "evaluator"
